# Backend API base URL.
#
# Only needed if the built-in default (src/services/api.ts) doesn't fit your
# setup:
#   - iOS simulator / web: default (http://localhost:8000) works as-is.
#   - Android emulator: default (http://10.0.2.2:8000) works as-is.
#   - Physical device (Android or iOS) over Expo Go/Wi-Fi: 'localhost' and
#     '10.0.2.2' don't reach your dev machine — set this to your machine's
#     LAN IP instead (same Wi-Fi network as the device), and make sure the
#     backend is started with --host 0.0.0.0 (see README.md).
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.23:8000
